<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plastall still in talks with Winbel, Winhold.</title>
<headline>Plastall still in talks with Winbel, Winhold.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plastall Ltd said on Thursday, referring to an earlier cautionery, that talks were still in progress with South African firms Winbel and Winhold which could have an impact on their share prices.</p>
<p>The firms urged shareholders to exercise caution in dealings in their shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
